# The Ta potential of HPO's LAMMPS-driven test cases (bench_pot.h):
# test_lammps_hessian.cpp, test_hpo_adjoint_pilot.cpp, bench_pair_tadah.cpp
# (CTest hpo_lammps_hessian, hpo_adjoint_pilot, hpo_bench_pair_tadah;
# ctest -L bench). TADAH_BENCH_POT names another one.
#
# Provenance: the lines below are Tadah.MLIP's Quick Start potential,
# docs/source/quickstart/pot.tadah at Tadah.MLIP commit c91e8ef (2026-10-07)
# (sha256 of its lines: 463e8ec88408c009b845d51e6f3d88bbcc123b60cddd64a3
# ec3e73092cbbe6cf), without its lines of the keys EWEIGHT, FWEIGHT,
# SWEIGHT and WDBFILE_AUTO, which Tadah! 1.6.0 retired and no load of a
# potential reads (sha256 of the lines below: 4dffbf7b2b7d352a39dfa92bf4f1
# 9b47a6431033f322d8bb5e271006c5edd77d). `tadah train -c config.train`
# wrote it in that directory: D2_Blip (4 functions, RCUT2B 5.3) +
# DM_mBlipEnv (5 embedding functions, RCUTMB 5.0), Cut_Cos, M_KRR
# Kern_Linear, 9 weights, fitted to the energies and stresses of the Quick
# Start's db.train (500 bcc Ta MD snapshots) by the fit of that commit;
# the copy keeps those weights.
#
# Why this one: the cases need a linear model (pair_style tadah's adjoint
# capture), no EAM fast path, at least 4 weights (the lattice cases require
# 4 and perturb WEIGHTS[2] = -10.48) and a physical bcc Ta: in the 4-atom cell of
# test_lammps_hessian.cpp it relaxes to a = 3.2944 A with C11 = 212 GPa and
# C12 = 91 GPa (the box block of the Hessian, V = 71.51 A^3). The shared
# Ta model of the HPO tests (data/ta/common/config.tadah, energies only)
# has C12 = -103 GPa there.
ATOM              Ta
BIAS              false
CEMBFUNC          0.5   0.75   1   1.25   1.5
CGRID2B           1   2.43333333333333357   3.8666666666666667   5.29999999999999982
CGRIDMB           2.87999999999999989
DIMER             false   0   false
ESHIFT_ATOM       false
ESHIFT_DBATOM     false
FORCE             false
INIT2B            true
INITMB            true
LAMBDA            9.99999999999999955e-08
LSCALE            1
MODEL             M_KRR   Kern_Linear   1
NORM              false
OALGO             1
RCTYPE2B          Cut_Cos
RCTYPEMB          Cut_Cos
RCUT2B            5.29999999999999982
RCUTENV           0.599999999999999978
RCUTMB            5
SEMBFUNC          2   2   2   2   2
SGRID2B           0.100000000000000033   0.21544346900318842   0.464158883361277919   0.999999999999999889
SGRIDMB           8
STRESS            true
TYPE2B            D2_Blip   4   4   Ta   Ta
TYPEMB            DM_mBlipEnv   0   1   1   5   5   Ta   Ta
UNCERTAINTY       false
WATOM             0.308999999999999997
WEIGHTS           133.357774127816555   -123.755171524655708   -10.4804763244958963   -18.0240635733812411   -6.3685917658913116   4.13446130558423164   -8.25236089850869803   3.95181987589451467   -6.04877887227442557
ZERO_COM_FORCE    false

